00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:10.788
Dying a child

00:00:10.812 --> 00:00:15.292
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:00:15.316 --> 00:00:19.663
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:00:19.687 --> 00:00:24.101
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:28.619
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:00:30.131 --> 00:00:34.745
Dying a child

00:00:34.769 --> 00:00:41.675
Oh, Child prey

00:00:43.611 --> 00:00:50.210
Oh, Child prey

00:00:52.353 --> 00:01:00.353
Hurry and May

00:01:01.062 --> 00:01:03.240
The reasons why one can't
laugh from the heart

00:01:03.264 --> 00:01:05.409
It's a simple reason... that's life

00:01:05.433 --> 00:01:09.947
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:09.971 --> 00:01:14.184
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:18.789
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:18.813 --> 00:01:22.926
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:27.464
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:27.488 --> 00:01:33.337
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:33.361 --> 00:01:38.275
Child is burning

00:01:38.299 --> 00:01:42.258
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:47.041 --> 00:01:48.185
Baki...

00:01:48.209 --> 00:01:52.156
You've finally learned how to
unleash your brain's endorphins...

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:56.426
But do not become intoxicated
by enthusiasm yet...

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:59.545
For Grapplers have even farther to go...

00:02:03.925 --> 00:02:05.415
It's time!

00:02:05.993 --> 00:02:10.007
Fear is the line that divides
weakness from strength.

00:02:10.031 --> 00:02:15.379
Unless you cross that line,
you'll never become a true Grappler.

00:02:15.403 --> 00:02:19.135
I'm gonna do it...
I have to cross the line.

00:02:26.113 --> 00:02:28.138
Oh, crap!

00:02:43.631 --> 00:02:45.409
When faced with death...

00:02:45.433 --> 00:02:49.446
it is said that a grappler's entire
life flashes before his eyes.

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:52.516
That focus greatly augments
their motor skills.

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:55.532
A phenomenon referred to
as "near-death focus"!

00:02:57.111 --> 00:03:01.658
Unless you attain it,
you'll never be a true grappler!

00:03:01.682 --> 00:03:05.641
Baki, can you cross that line?

00:03:11.492 --> 00:03:13.170
1 must be crazy...

00:03:13.194 --> 00:03:15.856
I'm really gonna die!

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:33.840
What's this? Is this death?
Am I... Am I dying?

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:58.703
<i>It's almost like I'm in slow motion!</i>

00:04:27.034 --> 00:04:30.914
I'm... I'm still alive...!
I'm still here, alive!

00:04:30.938 --> 00:04:36.968
I should've died... My... Somehow my
body just...! I crossed the line!

00:04:38.879 --> 00:04:42.247
I can... I can defeat him!

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:50.850
Yasha Ape! I'm ready! You hear me?
I'm coming for you!! Yasha!

00:05:31.165 --> 00:05:33.497
Long time, no see!

00:05:34.235 --> 00:05:38.968
No word on how you're doing, no letters.
I was beginning to think you didn't care.

00:05:41.909 --> 00:05:43.240
Heh!

00:05:46.981 --> 00:05:50.227
That's right, big guy... I did
all of this just for you.

00:05:50.251 --> 00:05:51.595
Kinda nice, huh?!

00:05:51.619 --> 00:05:54.731
No starting bell, but I think the
flames bring a lot to the table...

00:05:54.755 --> 00:05:56.985
Or should I say, the ring!f

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:03.290
The perfect spot to fight... and die!!

00:06:05.332 --> 00:06:07.323
Pay attention when I'm talking!

00:06:12.206 --> 00:06:13.435
I got "im!

00:06:19.814 --> 00:06:21.458
End of the line!

00:06:21.482 --> 00:06:22.643
Die!

00:06:27.321 --> 00:06:30.222
Your turn... Ape!

00:06:54.081 --> 00:06:55.981
That was gross!

00:06:56.917 --> 00:07:01.320
Okay, so, this is the part where
you fall over and die, right?!

00:07:23.811 --> 00:07:26.508
Great! Now he's showing off!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.424
<i>Is this thing for real?!</i>

00:08:00.047 --> 00:08:01.344
That worked!

00:08:21.302 --> 00:08:25.239
That hurt him! I guess we have
more in common than I thought.

00:08:36.016 --> 00:08:38.508
<i>He's weakest along his median line!</i>

00:08:48.596 --> 00:08:50.587
My combo didn't work!

00:09:07.648 --> 00:09:10.860
No matter where you go,
nothing beats the mountain air!

00:09:10.884 --> 00:09:13.319
Hm? Huh...

00:09:15.256 --> 00:09:17.691
Looks like ol' Baki left...

00:09:32.339 --> 00:09:35.900
Know your opponent, Baki. Focus...

00:09:36.844 --> 00:09:42.078
Nothing"s working... Everything I'm trying
was designed to be used on regular people.

00:09:42.549 --> 00:09:44.761
Fighting theories
based on human anatomy

00:09:44.785 --> 00:09:47.914
can't possibly be applied to
his super-thick muscles!

00:09:48.122 --> 00:09:49.487
I guess...

00:09:50.724 --> 00:09:52.783
...this is the only way!

00:09:58.098 --> 00:10:00.863
Again!

00:10:02.803 --> 00:10:05.602
And...again!!

00:10:20.754 --> 00:10:23.849
Yes! I did it!

00:10:28.862 --> 00:10:29.693
Take that!

00:10:30.764 --> 00:10:31.697
And that!

00:10:31.965 --> 00:10:35.299
What the...?! No way!

00:10:37.237 --> 00:10:39.215
Unbelievable!

00:10:39.239 --> 00:10:44.387
Nearly 200 pounds of
food is gone! Just gone!

00:10:44.411 --> 00:10:48.473
Baki, what are you thinking?
You still haven't given up yet?!

00:10:57.358 --> 00:10:59.122
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:11:48.542 --> 00:11:51.477
Is that all... you got?!

00:12:08.762 --> 00:12:13.393
Oh, great! Not sure how much good
this'll do against that monster...

00:12:13.567 --> 00:12:16.036
Baki! Please be all right!

00:12:39.993 --> 00:12:44.274
Six years ago, Yujiro fought and
killed one of the Yasha apes.

00:12:44.298 --> 00:12:48.144
But even though he succeeded,
the ape still possessed enough strength

00:12:48.168 --> 00:12:52.105
to nearly destroy someone
as powerful as Yujiro.

00:12:55.843 --> 00:12:57.937
Bahi is as good as dead!

00:12:59.446 --> 00:13:02.575
Fire?! What's going on?!

00:13:58.238 --> 00:14:00.434
Still... here!

00:14:04.411 --> 00:14:05.708
Ando...?!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:11.977
Baki! At least you're alive!
Leave the rest to me!

00:14:15.088 --> 00:14:18.149
Don't worry, Baki.
I'll kill this monster!

00:14:18.859 --> 00:14:20.937
Ando...

00:14:20.961 --> 00:14:23.157
Don't be stupid!

00:14:23.664 --> 00:14:24.774
What?

00:14:24.798 --> 00:14:26.809
"You'll kill this monster?!”

00:14:26.833 --> 00:14:30.780
I appreciate you trying to help, but
this is my fight, Ando. Just look at us.

00:14:30.804 --> 00:14:34.517
Cuts, bruises, broken bones - whatever!

00:14:34.541 --> 00:14:38.021
This thing might be different from you
and me, but he still knows how to hurt.

00:14:38.045 --> 00:14:41.572
I mean, look at his eye!
I gouged it out... and he ate it!!

00:14:42.482 --> 00:14:48.945
I need you to trust me, Ando! I can
handle this! Go on... Get outta here!

00:14:51.191 --> 00:14:55.526
Don't worry... I'm the
one who's takin® you out!

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:57.995
Baki!

00:15:15.582 --> 00:15:17.961
Am I dreaming?!

00:15:17.985 --> 00:15:23.333
Or am I really watching a 13-year-old boy
hold his ground against that monster?!

00:15:23.357 --> 00:15:28.158
Looks like Baki must have
aquired the "near-death focus™.

00:15:29.363 --> 00:15:31.422
Just like his father!

00:15:37.638 --> 00:15:41.632
If you're saying that you're
a tough opponent... I agree.

00:15:53.353 --> 00:15:58.067
I think Baki's fist just went through
the beast's eye and hit its brain.

00:15:58.091 --> 00:16:02.426
One thing's for certain...
He's definitely his father's son!

00:16:07.434 --> 00:16:10.028
Bring it on! This is it!

00:16:15.175 --> 00:16:16.700
Yep, that stings.

00:16:19.246 --> 00:16:21.524
Yeah! Come on! More!

00:16:21.548 --> 00:16:24.449
What are you doing?! Move away!

00:16:26.153 --> 00:16:27.587
Please work!

00:16:38.465 --> 00:16:42.402
He throttled its windpipe!
He just grabbed it with his fist!

00:16:54.081 --> 00:16:57.381
Hey! Baki! You won!

00:17:00.053 --> 00:17:02.432
I am the strongest!

00:17:02.456 --> 00:17:10.159
Do you hear me up there?! |I am
the strongest! I am the strongest!!

00:18:02.182 --> 00:18:06.881
Tracking you down is becoming a
full-time job. Breakfast is ready.

00:18:07.954 --> 00:18:11.534
What is it, Baki? Out with it,
what's on your mind?

00:18:11.558 --> 00:18:15.304
Ando... Do... do you think I won?

00:18:15.328 --> 00:18:16.038
What?

00:18:16.062 --> 00:18:19.542
I keep running through it in
my head, telling myself I did.

00:18:19.566 --> 00:18:22.311
But am I really trying to
justify harming a creature

00:18:22.335 --> 00:18:25.396
that wanted nothing more than
to live in peace with nature?

00:18:27.474 --> 00:18:28.873
Possibly.

00:18:32.312 --> 00:18:35.925
But remember... However you
choose to look at it...

00:18:35.949 --> 00:18:38.194
That was one amazing fight...

00:18:38.218 --> 00:18:41.831
A battle to the finish between
Baki Hanma and the Yasha Ape.

00:18:41.855 --> 00:18:45.868
You can sit here all day and dwell on
the moral implications of your actions,

00:18:45.892 --> 00:18:47.770
yet the simple fact remains...

00:18:47.794 --> 00:18:51.440
You challenged that creature
barehanded... and you won.

00:18:51.464 --> 00:18:54.593
I'd say Mother Nature agrees with me.

00:18:56.336 --> 00:18:59.649
If it bothers you...
why not pay it a visit?

00:18:59.673 --> 00:19:03.519
Huh? Ando... You mean to tell
me you know where it lives?!

00:19:03.543 --> 00:19:06.122
I want you to give it something for me.

00:19:06.146 --> 00:19:06.656
Huh?

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:08.944
Something only you can deliver.

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:19.435
You're on your own from here...

00:19:19.459 --> 00:19:22.872
The Yasha Ape lives in a
cave half way up this cliff.

00:19:22.896 --> 00:19:25.241
I would go there myself, if I could.

00:19:25.265 --> 00:19:29.545
But I haven't earned the right...
You have, Baki. It respects you.

00:19:29.569 --> 00:19:34.083
Now, you must ask yourself whether
you possess the will to deliver it.

00:19:34.107 --> 00:19:36.201
Alright, I'll do it.

00:19:52.893 --> 00:19:55.954
These must be its ancestors...!

00:20:05.272 --> 00:20:06.762
Yasha...

00:20:16.182 --> 00:20:17.946
Your wife.

00:20:20.754 --> 00:20:23.666
Six years ago, my father
took this from you.

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:26.352
It was given to me so
that I may now return it.

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:34.944
At that moment, 1 understood...
This wasn't just some monster.

00:20:34.968 --> 00:20:37.947
<i>It was an ancient being
as complex as any other,</i>

00:20:37.971 --> 00:20:42.084
bearing the weight of a culture whose
rituals and ideals flourished and withered

00:20:42.108 --> 00:20:45.078
fong before humanity
thought to give it a name.

00:20:52.686 --> 00:20:58.591
Thanks to you... I've grown, not
only in strength, but in wisdom!

00:20:59.759 --> 00:21:02.456
Forgive me for misjudging you!

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.765
A fang...

00:21:20.347 --> 00:21:21.746
Thank you.

00:21:25.785 --> 00:21:29.532
I get it. I'm just another human being...

00:21:29.556 --> 00:21:33.436
and I won't be able to beat the
forces of nature forever...

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:36.259
I'd be a fool to ever think I could try...

00:21:38.531 --> 00:21:41.844
What is the strength of a grappler
compared to the immensity of time...

00:21:41.868 --> 00:21:46.863
<i>It is the one opponent that
will never be dominated...</i>

00:21:47.407 --> 00:21:51.105
But I can sure give it my best shot!

00:22:00.987 --> 00:22:04.082
My journey has only begun!

00:22:44.597 --> 00:22:50.146
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.170 --> 00:22:55.751
<i>hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement</i>

00:22:55.775 --> 00:23:01.424
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.448 --> 00:23:06.429
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.453 --> 00:23:11.967
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:11.991 --> 00:23:17.506
<i>gently enveloped in love</i>

00:23:17.530 --> 00:23:23.179
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.203 --> 00:23:28.717
but they will be reborn

00:23:28.741 --> 00:23:34.390
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.414 --> 00:23:40.353
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:51.431 --> 00:23:52.975
The small ripple the boy created

00:23:52.999 --> 00:23:56.178
has begun to cause large waves
in the world of fighting.

00:23:56.202 --> 00:23:57.746
One man makes a move.

00:23:57.770 --> 00:24:02.751
Another accepts his challenge, and with
these two simple acts, a battie begins.

00:24:02.775 --> 00:24:06.122
However, no matter the opponent,
nor his prowess in the ring,

00:24:06.146 --> 00:24:08.190
one truth remains constant...

00:24:08.214 --> 00:24:13.662
Every match must end, and in doing so,
a victor is born... and a loser.

00:24:13.686 --> 00:24:18.180
<i>Still, as long as the warrior has pride,
his heart will not yield.</i>
